Package: jotdo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: reminders from your CalDAV server, in a terminal
 jotdo reads and writes the task lists on a CalDAV server (Nextcloud,
 Radicale, Baikal, Fastmail and others): the lists Apple Reminders,
 Tasks.org and jtx Board show. A phone sees an edit made in jotdo as an
 edit.
 .
 It has a terminal browser for lists, Today, Scheduled and an agenda,
 handles due dates, repeats and alerts typed as you would say them, and
 has a command line with JSON output for scripts.
